  "Second post of 'WHAT A WALKER DECK' by the same author the same day (first: DeckTech 9312); the description says it addresses mistakes in the first attempt pointed out by a reviewer. Different list (adds Emperor Palpatine, 2 Obsidian Squadron TIE, Overseeing It Personally, 2 Trample; drops Kiffex, OS-72-10, Obsidian 10, Too Cold For Speeders, Sunsdown, Presence Of The Force, Cane Adiss), so given its own page title.",
  "Starting cards as posted: Hoth: Ice Plains (5th Marker) (starting location; no objective), Prepared Defenses, Imperial Decree, Battle Order and Imperial Arrest Order; several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Qty 63 as published (section headers carry no counts). The strategy still mentions Kiffex, which is not in this list.",
  "Posted 'Darth Vader DLOTS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Boba Fett w/ Gun' Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'Mara's Lightsaber' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Tibbana Gas Miner' Tibanna Gas Miner; 'Chimera' Chimaera; 'Obsidan 7' Obsidian 7; 'Clouds' the generic Cloud City Clouds sector; 'Admirals Orders' is a header for We're In Attack Position Now."
